      "statement": "California homeowners appetite guidance is internal carrier underwriting guidance for eligibility, evidence, referral, binding, and authority decisions; it must not be used to expand, restrict, waive, or interpret policy coverage, and a referral is not itself a declination, approval, coverage grant, or claim settlement position.",
