      "statement": "A California roof aged 20 years or more requires an acceptable inspection before binding; active leakage generally requires completed documented repairs before binding, and roof deterioration, unresolved repairs, inadequate evidence, conflicting information, or inaccessible areas trigger referral or hold controls.",
